# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# Cloudflare serves both the apex and www, and every *.pages.dev preview URL.
# Left alone, that is the same content on three hostnames: split ranking
# signals, and Google picking a canonical for you. The site declares
# https://mbdulrohim.dev as canonical, so everything else must land there.

https://www.mbdulrohim.dev/*  https://mbdulrohim.dev/:splat  301
